From 7337930c43659c072c29afa33577cfe84b661a3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HYUNSOL MUN <muumthf@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:41:06 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] kcsan: execute candidate policy per campaign

Select one candidate policy from the manager's payload file. Register it
in each VM before starting the runner, then pass its candidate ID through
regular and snapshot execution requests to the policy generation ioctl.
Leave ordinary programs on the original generation path.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
